      {
        "author_name": "Yasaman Soudagar",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/114087089871193527184/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjWniIE0kEVgl1dblDCzqTye5ggE7kmQrqYf3UbLbrMKwVEFKut4=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "3 years ago",
        "text": "Allegiant was recommended to me by other optics companies when I started my company, Neurescence, about 7 years ago. I needed help with design and manufacturing optomechanics for our optical brain imaging multiscopes.\nSander, the founder of Allegiant, fully understood my requirements, which were quite demanding, as the parts were related to design and manufacturing of stable mm sized probes to implant in the brain. With Sander's creativity, out of the box thinking and detailed knowledge of optics, we found the perfect solution, which we still use. In fact, we continue to build upon with help from Allegiant.  These probes are our major differentiators in the market and are a subject of one of our patents.\nNeurescence got recently acquired by Bruker. THANK YOU team Allegiant 3D for sharing the startup journey with me when I had very limited resources and your continued help now that we have more resources!",
        "time": 1675987698,
        "translated": false
      },
